WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.868
-You told me to come at 09:00.
-That doesn't sound like me.

00:00:01.935 --> 00:00:03.670
"Why don't you come over
Tuesday morning at 09:00?

00:00:03.737 --> 00:00:06.373
Also, you should bring this email
because I might not remember it

00:00:06.439 --> 00:00:08.842
because I just took
a bunch of horse tranquillizers, ha ha.

00:00:08.908 --> 00:00:11.411
Also please don't put in my book
that I use horse tranquillizers."

00:00:11.478 --> 00:00:13.179
Then I think
you fell asleep on the keyboard

00:00:13.246 --> 00:00:15.281
because it just says
the letter B 27 times.

00:00:15.348 --> 00:00:16.649
That does sound like me.

